ered_source_round\":6,\"prior_deliveries\":4,\"query_key\":\"f72c838b65d7c2b9e1b6449863c23c78bbd7dda10a71f07633447262f8f9173c\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"acb3f4c9262996726ed4201d1860468e240cdf99e270ed025a0ab905cc5fff71\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Diamond Jenness memoir shaman mistaken word\",\"view\":\"reuse\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_a6b5e7cc28714ee6a8969e52"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[{\"end\":21000,\"ref\":\"e4\",\"start\":15000},{\"end\":27000,\"ref\":\"e5\",\"start\":21000},{\"end\":33000,\"ref\":\"e6\",\"start\":27000},{\"end\":35979,\"ref\":\"e7\",\"start\":33000}],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d11\"},\"ref\":\"d11\",\"snippet\":\" ... For example, Jenness was vice-president and later President of the American Anthropological Association,(1937-1940), President of the Society for American Archaeology (1937),Maxwell, Moreau S (1972) \\\"Diamond Jenness, 1886-1979.\\\" American Antiquity, v.37, Issue 1, p. 87 (Published online by Cambridge University Press.) and vice ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diamond_Jenness\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d13\"},\"ref\":\"d13\",\"snippet\":\" ... uniquely \\\"Dorset\\\" site, confirming Jenness's hunch, and establishing the Dorset culture as archaeological fact. He published the results of his archaeological investigations in an article entitled \\\"The Dorset Culture of the Eastern Arctic,\\\" which appeared in the American Anthropologist (New Series 42, 1940). ... The British Canadian Arctic ... \",\"title\":\"https://journalhosting.ucalgary.ca/index.php/arctic/article/view/63558\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d10\"},\"ref\":\"d10\",\"snippet\":\" ... THE DIARY OF DIAMOND JENNESS, 1913-1916. Edited by STUARTE. JENNESS. Hull: Canadian Museum of Civilization, 1991. 902 p., 208 illus. (maps, photos and draw-ings), appendices, index, bib. Hardbound. Cdn$65.00. This superbly edited volume brings into public view the complete arctic diary of Diamond Jenness ... \",\"title\":\"https://journalhosting.ucalgary.ca/index.php/arctic/article/download/64915/48829/184429\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d36\"},\"ref\":\"d36\",\"snippet\":\" ... Top 10 Archaeological Discoveries in the 20th Century\\ndate: 2025-01-01\\n---\\nTop 10 Archaeological Discoveries in the 20th Century\\n\\n#10: The World's Earliest Figurative Art\\n\\nLocated in southwest Indonesia are the caves in the Maros-Pangkep karst, which house the world's earliest pieces of figurative ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.watchmojo.com/articles/top-10-archaeological-discoveries-in-the-20th-century\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d19\"},\"ref\":\"d19\",\"snippet\":\" ... Diamond Jenness, 1886–1969\\ndate: 2017-12-07\\n---\\nDiamond Jenness, 1886–1969\\n\\nby Frank Oakes\\n\\nOf the many people who have resided in the Glebe over the past 100 years and more, few have accomplished so much or had such an adventurous and distinguished career as Diamond Jenness ... \",\"title\":\"https://glebereport.ca/articles/diamond-jenness-1886-1969/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"785a56df927d0d24fa06a59fd2da985f255e67188f919d2861bf6c642ec0863f\",\"replay_req